( F5 T2 V9: post_node_rhside_ratio_method -post_node_rhside_free (manual
  Professional 6.952): the ratio is the free right-hand side itself. Same
  mesh, von Mises plasticity, 2 iterations (not converged): the ratio
  equals the sum of post_node_rhside_free over the velocity dofs
  (checked in scripts/build_safe.sh). The GNU post_node_rhside_fixed /
  _free hold the largest absolute value per dof, the manual and the
  Professional the sum (BACKLOG C110), so the values differ from the
  Professional 02-08-2026 (ratio 1.23884). )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
materi_strain_plasti
end_initia
node 1  0 0
node 2  1 0
node 3  2 0
node 4  3 0
node 5  0 1
node 6  1 1
node 7  2 1
node 8  3 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 5 6
element 2 -quad4 2 3 6 7
element 3 -quad4 3 4 7 8
element_group 3 1
group_type 0 -materi
group_type 1 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 100.
group_materi_elasti_young 1 1000.
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_memory 1 -total_linear
bounda_dof 1 -ra 1 5 -ra -velx
bounda_dof 2 1 -vely
bounda_dof 3 -ra 4 8 -ra -velx
bounda_time 3 0. 0. 1. 0.1
geometry_point 1  3 0 1.e-4
geometry_line 2  3 0 3 1 1.e-4

group_materi_plasti_vonmises 1 1.
group_materi_plasti_vonmises 0 1.
control_timestep_iterations 0 2
post_node_rhside_ratio_method -post_node_rhside_free
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
